                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts498" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts522">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, you take two of four houndred level courses as a core requirement and two of four hundred level courses instead of the capstone project.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
