        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1673"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2470" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2484">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What did I watch when school was over?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1678"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2488" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2492">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Did I say school?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1679"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2496" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2512">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>After university, I bought and played games on Steam.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1684"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2516" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2544">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, it is a different game called zero escape, which is a logic game where nine people are trapped in what, a ship by someone.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1698"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2550" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2574">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And everyone has a braclet with a number from one to nine.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1706"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2576" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2584">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And they have nine hours to get out from the ship.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1710"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2588" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2624">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They need to go through doors and these doors have numbers such as number five or number one, and door with number nine is an exit, and they need to find it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1721"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2626" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2640">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But minimum three and maximum five people can go through one door.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1728"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2646" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2666">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And to go through the door, the digital root of their number, there is a thing...Tell me any number.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1738"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2670" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2674">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Number.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1739"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2676" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2678">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Thirteen?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1740"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2682" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2720">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>The digital root of thirteen is four because one plus three and if you have a large number, then you have to add them until you have one digit number.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1752"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2722" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2746">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And these digital root needs to match the door number and you have to find keys and so on.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
